openidea-bazel
Copyright 2026 David Vieira

This product ports, and ships a modified copy of, code from the Bazel plugin for
IntelliJ (https://github.com/bazelbuild/intellij, branch ijwb), Copyright 2016 The
Bazel Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

- aspect/: the plugin's Starlark aspect (aspect/*.bzl as realized for Bazel 7 by the
  plugin's AspectTemplateWriter). Modified so that its tool jars (PackageParser,
  JarFilter, CreateAar) are optional; changes are marked "openidea-bazel".
- src/: Rust ports of the project view parser, ImportRoots, target derivation, the
  aspect's output formats and the Java sync (JavaSourceFilter, SourceDirectoryCalculator,
  BlazeJavaWorkspaceImporter).
